<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="description" content="SV Real Estates Hyderabad Services — Luxury villa sales, HMDA plot investments, legal title verification, NRI property concierge, and commercial leasing.">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Stylesheets -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body class="site-body">
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <!-- Page Banner -->
    <section class="page-banner">
        <div class="container page-banner-inner">
            <span class="page-tag"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-gold"></i> BESPOKE SOLUTIONS • ALL OVER HYDERABAD</span>
            <h1 class="page-title">Our Advisory <span class="gold-gradient-text">Services</span></h1>
            <p class="page-subtitle">End-to-end real estate excellence engineered for homeowners, HNIs, and corporate investors all over Hyderabad.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Grid Section -->
    <section class="section services-page-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="services-full-grid">
                <!-- Service 1 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-home-user"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">01</span>
                        <h3>Luxury Villa Acquisitions</h3>
                        <p>We source, evaluate, and negotiate off-market and newly launched luxury villas in Hyderabad's most prestigious gated townships all over Hyderabad including Jubilee Hills, Banjara Hills, Kokapet, Tellapur, and Kompally.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Exclusive access to private estates & penthouses</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Vastu-compliant architectural assessments</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Direct builder negotiations for priority pricing</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 2 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-draw-polygon"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">02</span>
                        <h3>HMDA & DTCP Plot Investments</h3>
                        <p>Open plot land banking in high-growth corridors surrounding Outer Ring Road (ORR) and Regional Ring Road (RRR). Guaranteed 100% clear titles with all municipal sanctions in place.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Kokapet, Tellapur, Shankarpally, & Shamshabad sectors</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Fully developed layouts with BT roads & underground utilities</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Physical site demarcation & boundary wall supervision</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 3 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">03</span>
                        <h3>Comprehensive Legal & Title Due Diligence</h3>
                        <p>Never sign an agreement without absolute legal clarity. Our senior revenue legal counsel examines 30+ year records, Dharani portal entries, master plans, and court decrees.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Encumbrance certificates (EC) validation</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Master plan zoning verification (residential vs conservation)</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Title investigation reports (TIR) with formal legal opinion</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 4 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-plane-departure"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">04</span>
                        <h3>NRI Concierge & Portfolio Advisory</h3>
                        <p>Tailored real estate advisory for Non-Resident Indians residing in the USA, UK, UAE, and Singapore looking to build robust capital in Telangana without travel stress.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Power of Attorney (POA) registration assistance</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> High-definition 4K video walkthroughs and drone survey</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Chauffeured visits for visiting family members in Hyderabad</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 5 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-city"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">05</span>
                        <h3>Commercial Spaces & Highway Land</h3>
                        <p>Strategic retail showrooms, Grade-A office floors, and multi-acre development parcels fronting national and state highways for hospitals, institutions, or warehousing.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> High rental yield commercial spaces in Financial District</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Pre-leased assets with established blue-chip tenants</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Land aggregation for joint development projects</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 6 -->
                <div class="service-item-card">
                    <div class="svc-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i></div>
                    <div class="svc-content-box">
                        <span class="svc-num">06</span>
                        <h3>End-to-End Registration & Mutation</h3>
                        <p>From drafting bilingual Sale Deeds to scheduling Sub-Registrar / Dharani slots and executing municipal tax mutation, we navigate the entire bureaucratic process seamlessly.</p>
                        <ul class="svc-points">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> Stamp duty computation and challan generation</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> In-person representation at Sub-Registrar offices</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-gold"></i> GHMC / Municipality mutation and revenue passbook updates</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How We Work Process Section -->
    <section class="section process-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <span class="section-badge">TRANSPARENT WORKFLOW</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">The Four-Step <span class="gold-gradient-text">Acquisition Process</span></h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">A streamlined, stress-free methodology engineered for complete peace of mind.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="process-steps-grid">
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-num">01</div>
                    <h3>Consultation & Curation</h3>
                    <p>We analyze your investment horizon, preferred zones, budget parameters, and lifestyle expectations to curate a tailored shortlist.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-num">02</div>
                    <h3>Private Site Inspections</h3>
                    <p>Experience chauffeured private walkthroughs led by our location specialists who highlight master plan realities and surrounding infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-num">03</div>
                    <h3>Legal Vetting & Valuation</h3>
                    <p>Our legal team checks complete revenue registers, link deeds, and municipal sanctions while our analysts benchmark accurate market valuations.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-num">04</div>
                    <h3>Seamless Settlement</h3>
                    <p>From drafting legal agreements to Dharani registration, municipal mutation, and key handover, we manage every single step.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="cta-banner-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cta-banner-card">
                <div class="cta-text">
                    <h2>Ready to Experience Premier Real Estate Advisory?</h2>
                    <p>Contact our senior consultants today to discuss your acquisition, investment, or sale objectives.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="cta-buttons">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-gold btn-large" onclick="openConsultationModal('Service Consultation')">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Book Consultation
                    </button>
                    <a href="https://wa.me/<%= businessWhatsapp %>" target="_blank" class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-large">
                        <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Chat on WhatsApp
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
    <%- include('../partials/enquiry-modal') %>

    <!-- Scripts -->
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
